---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import principal from "../assets/principal.jpeg";
import { CONTACT } from "../consts.ts";
---
<section id="inicio" class="relative py-12 md:py-20 pt-20 min-h-[78vh] flex items-center justify-center bg-surface overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true">
    <Image
      src={principal}
      alt=""
      widths={[640, 960, 1280]}
      sizes="100vw"
      format="webp"
      quality={75}
      loading="eager"
      fetchpriority="high"
      class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-[0.07] grayscale"
    />
  </div>
  <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 relative z-10 text-center flex flex-col items-center">
    <p class="text-[14px] leading-5 font-semibold tracking-[0.05em] uppercase text-primary mb-4" style="font-family:'Hanken Grotesk',sans-serif;letter-spacing:0.05em">Firma de Abogados · Ipiales, Nariño</p>
    <h1 class="text-[32px] md:text-[48px] leading-[36px] md:leading-[56px] font-semibold text-on-surface mb-6 max-w-4xl" style="font-family:'EB Garamond',serif;letter-spacing:-0.02em">
      Ipial_abogados: <br /><span class="text-primary">Excelencia Jurídica</span> y Compromiso Humano
    </h1>
    <p class="text-[17px] md:text-[18px] leading-7 text-secondary mb-8 max-w-2xl">
      Asesoría legal especializada para brindarte la tranquilidad y seguridad que mereces, fundamentada en la integridad y el rigor profesional.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center mt-2">
      <a href={CONTACT.waPrimaryHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="bg-forest-deep text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-sm text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-teal-accent transition-colors duration-200 text-center">Contactar por WhatsApp</a>
      <a href="#servicios" class="bg-transparent border border-platinum-silver text-on-surface px-8 py-3 rounded-sm text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors duration-200 text-center">Nuestros Servicios</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div id="header-sentinel" aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-full absolute bottom-0 left-0"></div>
</section>
